(23, 536, 8)', NULL, '{"a": "(10, 106, 7)", "b": "(47, 2230, 17)", "c": "(16, 285, 25)", "d": "(9, 109, 24)"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'Pattern: Second number = (First number)² + (Third number - 1), or b = a² + (c - 1).
- Set 1: (24, 578, 3) -> 24² + (3 - 1) = 576 + 2 = 578.
- Set 2: (23, 536, 8) -> 23² + (8 - 1) = 529 + 7 = 536.
