  'In the following triads, each group of letters is related to the subsequent one following a certain logic. Select
from the given options, the one which follows the same logic.
HUGE - UEGH - EGUH
LIST - ITSL - TSIL362', NULL, '{"a": "EAST - AEST - TASE", "b": "HEAR - ERAH - RAEH", "c": "VIBE - IVBE - EIBV", "d": "BANK - BNAK - KNAB"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'b',
