4. K # E -> K is the daughter of E. Since P is already K''s mother, E must be K''s father and P''s husband.
Since P is the wife of E, and D is the mother of P, D is the wife''s mother of E.
Hence, option (C) is the correct answer.', NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verified'
)
