1. L % R -> L is the father of R.
2. R - K -> R is the brother of K (L is also the father of K).
3. K + V -> K is the mother of V.
4. V # E -> V is the daughter of E.
From (1), (2), and (3): K is the daughter of L, and V is the daughter of K.
