  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH02_Q0015', 2382, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch02', 2, 'Blood Relation', 15,
  'Linear Coded Relations', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC Graduate Level (2025/2026) - 25/03/2026 (9:00 AM - 10:30 AM)', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '25/03/2026', '9:00 AM - 10:30 AM', 'Graduate',
  'In a certain code language,
A + B means ''A is the mother of B''
A - B means ''A is the brother of B''
A x B means ''A is the wife of B''
A % B means ''A is the father of B''
