Based on the above, how is L related to E if ''L # N - C # V x E''?', NULL, '{"a": "Son''s daughter", "b": "Daughter''s son", "c": "Brother''s daughter", "d": "Father''s mother"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'Given code definitions:
- A + B means ''A is the mother of B''
- A - B means ''A is the brother of B''
