- Option C (IKLN): I(9) + 2 = K(11), K(11) + 1 = L(12), L(12) + 2 = N(14) -> Pattern: [+2, +1, +2]
- Option D (LMNP): L(12) + 1 = M(13), M(13) + 1 = N(14), N(14) + 2 = P(16) -> Pattern: [+1, +1, +2]
Option D starts with +1 instead of +2.
