  'Symmetric Positional Shift Matching', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC Graduate Level (2025/2026) - 25/03/2026 (12:45 PM - 2:15 PM)', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '25/03/2026', '12:45 PM - 2:15 PM', 'Graduate',
  'Which of the following letter-clusters should replace # and % so that the pattern and relationship followed
between the letter-cluster pair on the left side of :: is the same as that on the right side of :: ?
# : NXF :: JTB : %', NULL, '{"a": "# = CMU % = UEN", "b": "# = CNU % = UEM", "c": "# = DMU % = UEM", "d": "# = CMU % = UEM"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'd',
  'Given expression: # : NXF :: JTB : %
Testing Option D (# = CMU, % = UEM):
- Left side (# : NXF, i.e., CMU : NXF):
 C(3) + 11 = N(14)
 M(13) + 11 = X(24)
 U(21) - 15 = F(6)
 The shifts are [+11, +11, -15].

- Right side (JTB : %, i.e., JTB : UEM):
 J(10) + 11 = U(21)
 T(20) - 15 = E(5)
 B(2) + 11 = M(13)
 Both pairs apply the identical shift structure [+11, +11, -15] with corresponding rotation.
Hence, option (D) is the correct answer.', NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verified'
)
