 N(14) + 7 = U(21)
 All letters shift by +7.
- Right side (WZF : %, i.e., WZF : DGM):
 W(23) + 7 = D(4) (wrapping modulo 26: 30 - 26 = 4)
 Z(26) + 7 = G(7) (wrapping modulo 26: 33 - 26 = 7)
 F(6) + 7 = M(13)
 All letters shift by +7.
Both sides follow the constant shift of +7.
Hence, option (A) is the correct answer.', NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verified'
)
