  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH04_Q0032', 2512, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch04', 4, 'Coding-Decoding', 32,
  'Constant Positional Shift', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC Graduate Level (2025/2026) - 22/03/2026 (9:00 AM - 10:30 AM)', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '22/03/2026', '9:00 AM - 10:30 AM', 'Graduate',
  'Which of the following letter-clusters should replace # and % so that the pattern and relationship followed
between the letter-cluster pair on the left side of :: is the same as that on the right side of :: ?
# : LKP :: TSX : %1319', NULL, '{"a": "# = QIV % = OLL", "b": "# = ISU % = ONM", "c": "# = QPU % = ONS", "d": "# = QNU % = OIB"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'c',
  'Given expression: # : LKP :: TSX : %
Testing Option C (# = GFK, % = YTC):
- Left side (# : LKP, i.e., GFK : LKP):
