- Right side (TSX : %, i.e., TSX : YTC):
 T(20) + 5 = Y(25)
 S(19) + 5 = X(24)
 X(24) + 5 = C(3) (wrapping modulo 26: 29 - 26 = 3)
 All letters advance by +5.
Both sides follow the exact constant shift of +5.
Hence, option (C) is the correct answer.', NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verified'
)
