  'Set Intersection / Unique Digit Identification', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC Graduate Level (2025/2026) - 17/03/2026 (9:00 AM - 10:30 AM)', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '17/03/2026', '9:00 AM - 10:30 AM', 'Graduate',
  'In a certain code language, ''ROAD'' is coded as ''9416'' and ''DORM'' is coded as ''3691''. What is the code for
