) VALUES (
  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH04_Q0102', 2582, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch04', 4, 'Coding-Decoding', 102,
  'Increasing Positional Shift Series', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC Graduate Level (2025/2026) - 18/03/2026 (4:30 PM - 6:00 PM)', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '18/03/2026', '4:30 PM - 6:00 PM', 'Graduate',
  'RILA is related to SKOE in a certain way based on the English alphabetical order. In the same way, KEPO is
related to LGSS. To which of the following is MJRT related, following the same logic?', NULL, '{"a": "NOYZ", "b": "NLUX", "c": "NMWX", "d": "NKTY"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'b',
  'Analyze the letter transformations in the reference pairs:
1. ''RILA'' to ''SKOE'':
- R(18) + 1 = S(19)
- I(9) + 2 = K(11)
- L(12) + 3 = O(15)
- A(1) + 4 = E(5)
Pattern: [+1, +2, +3, +4].

2. ''BFKT'' to ''CHNY'':
- B(2) + 1 = C(3)
- F(6) + 2 = H(8)
- K(11) + 3 = N(14)
- T(20) + 4 = X... Y(25)? wait: [+1, +2, +3, +4].

3. Applying to ''MJRT'':
- M(13) + 1 = N(14)
