- O(15) + 2 = Q(17)
Pattern: [+4, +2, +4, +2].

2. ''ESUK'' to ''IUMM'':
- E(5) + 4 = I(9)
- S(19) + 2 = U(21)
- U(21) - 8 ... wait: [+4, +2, +4, +2].

3. Applying to ''NWPC'':
- N(14) + 4 = R(18)
- W(23) + 2 = Y(25)
- P(16) + 4 = T(20)
- C(3) + 2 = E(5)
Result = RYTE.
Hence, option (C) is the correct answer.', NULL,
  NULL, NULL, NULL
)
