  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH05_Q0013', 2607, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch05', 5, 'Data Sufficiency', 13,
  'Linear Ordering Sufficiency', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC Graduate Level (2025/2026) - 16/03/2026 (12:45 PM - 2:15 PM)', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '16/03/2026', '12:45 PM - 2:15 PM', 'Graduate',
  'In this question, a question is followed by two statements numbered (I) and (II). You have to decide whether
