3. Right turn, drives 27 km -> (-13, -22 + 27) = (-13, +5), facing North.
4. Right turn, drives 21 km -> (-13 + 21, +5) = (+8, +5), facing East.
5. Final right turn, drives 5 km -> (+8, +5 - 5) = (+8, 0), facing South. Stops at Point P(+8, 0).

