3. Left turn, drives 54 km -> (+40, -42 + 54) = (+40, +12), facing North.
4. Left turn, drives 48 km -> (+40 - 48, +12) = (-8, +12), facing West.
5. Final left turn, drives 12 km -> (-8, +12 - 12) = (-8, 0), facing South. Stops at Point P(-8, 0).

To reach Point A(0, 0) from Point P(-8, 0):
- Shortest distance = 8 km
- Direction = towards the East (from -8 back to 0).
