logically complete?
QIL 14, UMP 18, YQT 22, CUX 26, ?', NULL, '{"a": "HZC 29", "b": "GZD 30", "c": "GXZ 32", "d": "GYB 30"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'd', 'Analyze the letter and number progressions:
