- Second letters: I(9) + 4 = M(13), M(13) + 4 = Q(17), Q(17) + 4 = U(21), U(21) + 4 = Y(25)
- Third letters: L(12) + 4 = P(16), P(16) + 4 = T(20), T(20) + 4 = X(24), X(24) + 4 = B(2)
- Numbers: 14 + 4 = 18, 18 + 4 = 22, 22 + 4 = 26, 26 + 4 = 30
Combining terms gives: GYB 30.
Hence, option (D) is the correct answer.', NULL,
  NULL, NULL, NULL
)
