  <rect x="40" y="45" width="360" height="115" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e2e8f0"/>
  <text x="55" y="75" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">1. Clockwise 90° rotation in each successive step.</text>
  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">2. 0° (Up) -&gt; 90° (Right) -&gt; 180° (Down) -&gt; 270° (Left).</text>
  <rect x="40" y="170" width="360" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="220" y="193" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Next in Series: Option (D) is Correct</text>
</svg>', NULL,
