  <text x="55" y="135" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0284c7">Figure 3: 12 + 8 + 9 + 3 = 32 = ? × 8 => ? = 4.</text>
  <rect x="40" y="200" width="380" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
