ertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'b', 'Figure 1: 2^2 + 1^2 + 5^2 = 4 + 1 + 25 = 30 = 5 × 6
Figure 2: 3^2 + 5^2 + 4^2 = 9 + 25 + 16 = 50 = 5 × 10
Figure 3: 1^2 + 3^2 + 2^2 = 1 + 9 + 4 = 14 = ? × 2 => ? = 7.
Hence option (b) is correct.
