  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH09_Q0065', 2773, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch09', 9, 'Number Series / Missing Number', 65,
  'Visual Number Series / Missing Number', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 04.03.2021 (Shift-II) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Study the given pattern carefully and select the number that can replace the question mark (?) in it.
[Diagram: Three right-angled triangles: Triangle 1 (vertex 3, hypotenuse 7, base 6, center 39); Triangle 2 (vertex 4, hypotenuse 3, base 12, center 60); Triangle 3 (vertex 2, hypotenuse 6, base 18, center ?)]', NULL, '{"a": "48\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">48</text>\n</svg>", "b": "26\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">26</text>\n</svg>", "c": "30\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30</text>\n</svg>", "d": "24\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">24</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'From figure I: (7 + 6) × 3 = 13 × 3 = 39
From figure II: (3 + 12) × 4 = 15 × 4 = 60
From figure III: (6 + 18) × 2 = 24 × 2 = 48.
Hence ? = 48. Option (a) is correct.
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 460 250" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:460px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
  <rect width="460" height="250" fill="#f8fafc" rx="8" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <text x="230" y="24" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Missing Number Solution Breakdown</text>
  <rect x="40" y="45" width="380" height="145" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e2e8f0"/>
  <text x="55" y="75" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" fill="#334155">From figure I: (7 + 6) × 3 = 13 × 3 = 39</text>
  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" fill="#334155">From figure II: (3 + 12) × 4 = 15 × 4 = 60</text>
  <text x="55" y="135" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0284c7">From figure III: (6 + 18) × 2 = 24 × 2 = 48.</text>
  <rect x="40" y="200" width="380" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="230" y="223" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Result (?) = 48 (Option A is Correct)</text>
</svg>', NULL, true, 'missing_number', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 220" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:440px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
