  <text x="55" y="75" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" fill="#334155">18 / 3 = 6 = 2 + 3 + 1</text>
  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" fill="#334155">42 / 3 = 14 = 3 + 4 + 7</text>
  <text x="55" y="135" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0284c7">? / 2 = 11 + 3 + 6 = 20 => ? = 20 × 2 = 40.</text>
  <rect x="40" y="200" width="380" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="230" y="223" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Result (?) = 40 (Option B is Correct)</text>
</svg>', NULL, true, 'missing_number', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 220" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:440px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
