  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH09_Q0086', 2794, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch09', 9, 'Number Series / Missing Number', 86,
  'Visual Number Series / Missing Number', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 17.02.2021 (Shift-II) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Select the letter that can replace the question mark (?) in the figure below.
[Diagram: Square divided into eight triangular sectors with letters: D, F, I, M, R, X, E, ?]', NULL, '{"a": "X\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">X</text>\n</svg>", "b": "W\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">W</text>\n</svg>", "c": "M\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">M</text>\n</svg>", "d": "P\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">P</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'c',
  'According to alphabetical order and difference:
D(4) (+2) -> F(6) (+3) -> I(9) (+4) -> M(13) (+5) -> R(18) (+6) -> X(24) (+7) -> E(5) (+8) -> M(13).
Hence, ? = M. Option (c) is correct.
