  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" fill="#334155">Hence, ? = M. Option (c) is correct.</text>
  <text x="55" y="135" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0284c7">Pattern III: (?) = M</text>
