  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH09_Q0092', 2800, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch09', 9, 'Number Series / Missing Number', 92,
  'Visual Number Series / Missing Number', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 11.03.2021 (Shift-I) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Study the given pattern carefully and select the letter that can replace the question mark (?) in it.
[Diagram: Pyramid of boxes with letters: Row 1 (J); Row 2 (F, D); Row 3 (D, ?, E); Row 4 (A, E, C, A)]', NULL, '{"a": "F\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">F</text>\n</svg>", "b": "A\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">A</text>\n</svg>", "c": "B\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">B</text>\n</svg>", "d": "H\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">H</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'b',
  'Sum of letter values in each row equals 10:
J = 10
F + D = 6 + 4 = 10
A + E + C + A = 1 + 5 + 3 + 1 = 10
Similarly, D + ? + E = 4 + ? + 5 = 10 => ? = 10 - 9 = 1 = A.
Hence ? = A. Option (b) is correct.
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 460 250" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:460px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
