  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" fill="#334155">3 Pentagons = 15 => Value of one pentagon = 15 /</text>
  <text x="55" y="135" font-family="monospace" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0284c7">3 Circles = 6 => Value of one circle = 6 / 3 = 2</text>
  <rect x="40" y="200" width="380" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="230" y="223" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Result (?) = 11 (Option D is Correct)</text>
</svg>', NULL,
