  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH09_Q0106', 2814, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch09', 9, 'Number Series / Missing Number', 106,
  'Visual Number Series / Missing Number', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 09.03.2021 (Shift-I) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Study the given pattern carefully and select the letter that can replace the question mark (?) in it.', NULL, '{"a": "M\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">M</text>\n</svg>", "b": "O\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">O</text>\n</svg>", "c": "N\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">N</text>\n</svg>", "d": "Q\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Q</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'Just as,
2 + 4 + 6 = 12 = L (Place value in alphabet)
17 + 4 + 1 = 22 = V (Place value in alphabet)
8 + 12 + 3 = 23 = W (Place value in alphabet)
Similarly,
7 + 5 + 1 = 13 = M (Place value in alphabet).
Hence, option (a) is correct.
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 460 250" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:460px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
  <rect width="460" height="250" fill="#f8fafc" rx="8" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
