  'Seven boxes, A, B, C, D, E, F and G, are kept one over the other but not necessarily in the same order. Only G is kept above C. Only E is kept between C and F. Only D is kept below B. How many boxes are kept below F?', NULL, '{"a": "3", "b": "1", "c": "2", "d": "4"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'Step-by-step deduction:
