  'Each of P, Q, R, S, T, U and V has an exam on a different day of a week starting from Monday and ending on Sunday of the same week. P has the exam on Wednesday. Only three people have exams after R. S has the exam after Q but before P. U has the exam before V but not on Friday. How many people have exams between T and Q?', NULL, '{"a": "Two", "b": "Three", "c": "One", "d": "Four"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'b',
  'Step-by-step deduction:
