6. The remaining floor is Floor 6 = S.
7. Floors: Floor 6 = S, Floor 5 = Q, Floor 4 = P, Floor 3 = U, Floor 2 = T, Floor 1 = R.
8. Number of people living below T (Floor 2) = Floor 1 = 1 person (R).
Hence, the correct option is A (1).', NULL,
