  'Each of A, B, C, D, E and F visited the same shopping mall on a different day of a week starting from Monday and ending on Saturday of the same week. D visited the mall on Tuesday. Only two people visited the mall between B and D. C visited the mall immediately before F. A didn''t visit the mall on a Saturday. Who visited the mall on Wednesday?', NULL, '{"a": "E", "b": "F", "c": "A", "d": "C"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'd',
