  'M, N, O, P, E and F live on six different floors of the same building. The lowermost floor in the building is numbered 1, the floor above it is numbered 2 and so on till the topmost floor is numbered 6. E lives on the topmost floor. Only three people live between E and M. O lives on a floor below M. N lives on an even- numbered floor. P lives on an odd-numbered floor but not on floor number 5. How many people live between F and M?', NULL, '{"a": "Two", "b": "Three", "c": "Four", "d": "One"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
