  'P, Q, R, S, T, U and V sit around a circular table facing the centre. V sits to the immediate left of T. U sits to the immediate left of R. R sits second to the left of S. Q sits third to the left of T. Who sits 2 to the right of S?', NULL, '{"a": "P", "b": "R", "c": "T", "d": "U"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'c',
