  'Seven people, K, L, M, N, P, Q and R, are sitting around a circular table facing the centre of the table but not necessarily in the same order. Only two people sit between R and N when counted from the left of N. L sits third to the left of Q. P sits to the immediate right of Q. P sits second to the left of R. M is not an immediate neighbour of L. Who sits third to the right of K?', NULL, '{"a": "R", "b": "Q", "c": "M", "d": "P"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'd',
  'Step-by-step deduction:
