3. ''L sits third to the left of Q'', ''P sits to the immediate right of Q'', ''P sits second to the left of R''.
4. ''M is not an immediate neighbour of L''.
5. Circular placement: K, N, L, M, R, P, Q.
6. Who sits third to the right of K? Counting 3 positions counter-clockwise from K yields P.
Hence, the correct option is D (P).', NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verified'
)
