  'Linear Seating Arrangement', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC Graduate Level', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '22/03/2026', '9:00 AM - 10:30 AM', 'Graduate',
  'Seven people, A, B, C, D, E, F and G, are sitting in a row, facing north. Only two people sit to the left of C. Only three people sit between C and F. B sits second to the right of C. Only two people sit between B and D. E sits at some place to the right of G but at some place to the left of A. How many people sit to the left of D?', NULL, '{"a": "1", "b": "3", "c": "4", "d": "2"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'Step-by-step deduction:
1. 7 people in straight line facing north (positions 1 to 7 left to right).
2. ''Only two people sit to the left of C'' -> Position 3 = C.
3. ''Only three people sit between C and F'' -> Position 7 = F (positions 4, 5, 6 between).
