(I) Some pigs are lions: False, no relation is given between pigs and lions.
(II) Some pigs are monkeys: False, pigs are cats, but not necessarily monkeys.
Neither conclusion (I) nor (II) follows.
Hence, the correct option is B.', NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verified'
)
