(I) All chimpanzees are monkeys: False, only some chimpanzees (those that are baboons) are monkeys.
(II) Some chimpanzees are gorillas: False, no intersection between baboons/chimpanzees and gorillas is required.
Neither conclusion (I) nor (II) follows.
Hence, the correct option is A.', NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verified'
