  'Refer to the following number and symbol series and answer the question that follows. All numbers are single-digit numbers only. (Left) $ 8 6 2 @ $ # 1 5 # % * 9 7 5 @ 3 # 1 * 4 $ (Right) If all the symbols are dropped from the series, which of the following will be sixth from the right?', NULL, '{"a": "5", "b": "9", "c": "3", "d": "7"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'b', 'Step-by-step deduction:
Evaluating the sequence for the requested element gives 9.
Hence, the correct option is B (9).', NULL,
  NULL, NULL, NULL
)
