  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH14_Q0019', 3089, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch14', 14, 'Venn Diagram', 19,
  'Visual Venn Diagram', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 23.07.2021 (Shift-I) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Which of the following Venn diagrams represents the given statements?
Some scientists are professors.
All scientists are employees.
