  'rrb_ntpc_graduate_pyq_master', 3094, 14, 'reason_ch14', 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'Venn Diagram', 'Graduate',
  'Which of the following diagram best depicts the relationship between A, B and C, where A means ''Colour of the leaves'', B means ''Yellow coloured things'' and C means ''Green coloured things''?', NULL, '{"a": "Option (a)\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 80\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(A)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"35\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"35\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#4ade80\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"50\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#facc15\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n</svg>", "b": "Option (b)\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 80\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(B)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"40\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"40\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#4ade80\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"122\" cy=\"40\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#facc15\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n</svg>", "c": "Option (c)\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 80\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#4ade80\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#facc15\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n</svg>", "d": "Option (d)\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 80\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"40\" r=\"26\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#4ade80\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"40\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#facc15\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'b', 'Leaves can be green or yellow (so A intersects both B and C), while Yellow and Green are two mutually exclusive colours (B and C do not intersect). Hence, option (b) will be correct.
