  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH16_Q0014', 3224, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch16', 16, 'Line and Figure Counting', 14,
  'Visual Line and Figure Counting', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 11.03.2021 (Shift-II) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Find the number of triangles in the figure given below :', NULL, '{"a": "46 triangles\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">46 triangles</text>\n</svg>", "b": "44 triangles\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">44 triangles</text>\n</svg>", "c": "40 triangles\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">40 triangles</text>\n</svg>", "d": "42 triangles\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">42 triangles</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'By joining the diagonals ofa square rectangle
8 triangle are formed.
Number of triangle formed from four different squares
= 8+8+8+8 = 32
Number of triangles formed from joining two squares =
2+2+2 = 6
The number of triangles formed by dividing a triangle
in to two parts is 3.
Number of triangles = 3 + 3 = 6
Total number of triangles = 32 + 6 + 6 = 44
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 250" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:440px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
