  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH16_Q0023', 3233, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch16', 16, 'Line and Figure Counting', 23,
  'Visual Line and Figure Counting', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 09.03.2021 (Shift-I) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Find the number of squares in the given figure.', NULL, '{"a": "36\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">36</text>\n</svg>", "b": "41\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">41</text>\n</svg>", "c": "30\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30</text>\n</svg>", "d": "29\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">29</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'A structure formed by squares. Big squares
are divided in four small squares. Each small square
contains Six squares.
So, square formed by each four squares = 6 + 6 + 6 + 6
= 24
Four small squares made 6 new square.
Hence, total number of squares = 24 + 6
= 30
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 250" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:440px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
  <rect width="440" height="250" fill="#f8fafc" rx="8" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
