  <rect x="40" y="45" width="360" height="145" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e2e8f0"/>
  <text x="55" y="75" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">1. Top Section (ADE): Single = 3, Double = 2, Triple = 1 ⇒ 6</text>
  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">2. Entire Triangle (ABC): Single = 3, Double = 2, Triple = 1 ⇒ 6</text>
  <text x="55" y="135" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">3. Total Triangles = 6 + 6 = 12</text>
  <rect x="40" y="200" width="360" height="38" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="220" y="224" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Total Triangles = Option (A) is Correct</text>
