ill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">16</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'Total number of straight lines in two
quadrilateral figures = 2 x 4 = 8
Number of straight lines between sides = 2
Diagonal straight lines = 2
Total number of straight lines = 8+2+2 = 12
