) VALUES (
  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH18_Q0001', 3242, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch18', 18, 'Cube and Dice', 1,
  'Visual Cube and Dice', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 28.12.2020 (Shift-I) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Four different positions of a cube are shown in the figure. Which of the following colour is on the face opposite to the face that has black written on it?', NULL, '{"a": "Pink\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">Pink</text>\n</svg>", "b": "Blue\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Blue</text>\n</svg>", "c": "Orange\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Orange</text>\n</svg>", "d": "Purple\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Purple</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'According to the rule of cube, if two depicted
faces of two cubes are same, then the third faces will be
opposite to each other. The first and third cube have two
same faces, hence third faces of them will be opposite
to each other. Hence opposite face of Black will be
Orange.
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 240" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:440px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
  <rect width="440" height="240" fill="#f8fafc" rx="8" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <text x="220" y="24" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Opposite Faces Rule / विपरीत फलक नियम</text>
  <rect x="40" y="45" width="360" height="135" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e2e8f0"/>
  <text x="55" y="75" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">1. Faces common between Dice I &amp; II: 1 and 3</text>
  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">2. Rule: If two faces are common, the remaining third faces</text>
  <text x="70" y="125" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0369a1">are strictly opposite to each other.</text>
  <text x="55" y="155" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">3. Face 2 is strictly opposite to Face 5.</text>
  <rect x="40" y="190" width="360" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="220" y="213" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Correct Face: Option (A)</text>
</svg>', NULL, true, 'cube_dice', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 420 220" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:420px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
