" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  '2 3
If two faces of two dice are same then third face will be
opposite to each other.
Hence the opposite of ''5'' will be ''4''.
