\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">D</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a', '4
6 5 2 3
The opposite surfaces in the given sheet are as follows-
6+2
4.1
Two opposite surfaces are not visible together in a cube.
Hence option (a) will be the correct answer.
