  'RRB_NTPC_REASON_CH18_Q0015', 3256, 'General Intelligence and Reasoning', 'reason_ch18', 18, 'Cube and Dice', 15,
  'Visual Cube and Dice', 'RRB NTPC', 'RRB NTPC 20.01.12021 (Shift-II) Stage Ist', 'Stage-I / Stage-II', '', '', 'Graduate',
  'Three different positions of the same dice are shown. Select the letter that will be on the face opposite of the one having U ?', NULL, '{"a": "T\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">(A)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">T</text>\n</svg>", "b": "R\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(B)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">R</text>\n</svg>", "c": "S\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(C)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">S</text>\n</svg>", "d": "P\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">P</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'From dice (i) and (ii)
Q s
Opposite face
R U
Common face Q
Hence, letter ''P'' will be on the face opposite to U.
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 240" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:440px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
  <rect width="440" height="240" fill="#f8fafc" rx="8" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <text x="220" y="24" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Opposite Faces Rule / विपरीत फलक नियम</text>
  <rect x="40" y="45" width="360" height="135" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e2e8f0"/>
  <text x="55" y="75" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">1. Faces common between Dice I &amp; II: 1 and 3</text>
  <text x="55" y="105" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">2. Rule: If two faces are common, the remaining third faces</text>
  <text x="70" y="125" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0369a1">are strictly opposite to each other.</text>
  <text x="55" y="155" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">3. Face 2 is strictly opposite to Face 5.</text>
  <rect x="40" y="190" width="360" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="220" y="213" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Correct Face: Option (A)</text>
</svg>', NULL, true, 'cube_dice', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 420 220" width="100%" height="auto" style="max-width:420px; display:block; margin:10px auto; background:#ffffff;">
