  <text x="55" y="135" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#334155">3. Point R corresponds to 1.20 on the scale.</text>
  <rect x="40" y="165" width="360" height="38" rx="6" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="220" y="189" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Correct Point: Option (A)</text>
