ont-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">People who like chocolate, candy and ice-cream</text>\n</svg>", "d": "People who only like chocolate and candy\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" style=\"max-width:180px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; background:#ffffff;\">\n  <rect width=\"180\" height=\"75\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">(D)</text>\n  <text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">People who only like chocolate and candy</text>\n</svg>"}'::jsonb, NULL, 'a',
  'Ans. (c) : According to the question,
Ice-cream
Chocolate
